    text If the object does not provide , the function tries its best to gather information from the object’s attribute, if defined, and from its type object. The resulting list is not necessarily complete and may be inaccurate when the object has a custom . @17,13510,663,61
    link __dir__() ../reference/datamodel.html#object.__dir__ @17,13583,663,20
