    text This function is invoked by the statement. It can be replaced (by importing the module and assigning to ) in order to change semantics of the statement, but doing so is discouraged as it is usually simpler to use import hooks (see ) to attain the same goals and does not cause issues with code which assumes the default import implementation is in use. Direct use of is also discouraged in favor of . @17,56947,663,102
